                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/14239: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-10-29T14:00:00-05:00">October 29, 1938—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>371. Your 688, October 28, 9 a.m., paragraph 3, third sentence. In as much as the
                    Department is giving current consideration to a closely related matter, please
                    withhold action pending further instruction from the Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
